# Smart Dimension on two points. A, then B, then the label placed above them
# and between them: the horizontal distance B.x - A.x, its value typed in
# the editor that opens there (d1). Then on the selection of A and B, M to
# the distance, and Esc in the editor keeps the measured value (d2).
open tests/data/sketch-dimension.json
wait 16
action tool.dimension
wait 2
click L 305 522
click L 488 430
move 396 376 3
wait 2
click L 396 376
wait 2
text "1.2"
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
select element A element B
action tool.dimension
wait 2
action tool.method
wait 2
click L 579 576
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
